    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HCJN35GK7EEVY0KFF13GDXT4\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how you can use <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360025834271\">tags</a> to organize your campaigns by type, location, and more. Tagging can help you sort and search through your campaigns more easily, allowing to get a high-level look at a certain group's performance. This can be especially important for larger businesses where multiple people are creating campaigns. </p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>If you'd like to learn how to add dynamic content to your campaigns, head to our guide on <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408802648731\">message personalization</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCJN35GK13TW1BVCRA97FV5X\">Add tags when creating a new campaign</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Campaigns &gt; Create campaign</strong>.</li>\n<li>Name the campaign and select the channel. </li>\n<li>Scroll down until you see the <em>Tags </em>section. </li>\n<li>Start typing to either find an existing tag or to add a new one. <br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34635148619675\" alt=\"The Tags field when creating a new campaign\" width=\"326\" height=\"583\">\n</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Continue </strong>to finish drafting your campaign.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Campaigns can have more than one tag unless the tag belongs to a tag group that is exclusive. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCJN35GKSG639V9NSDSEY8NM\">Add tags to an existing campaign</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Campaigns</strong> tab in Klaviyo. </li>\n<li>Click the checkbox next to one or more campaigns from the list view. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Add tags.</strong><br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28704476561179\" alt=\"Add tags to campaigns\">\n</li>\n<li>Choose or create a new tag. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Add tags</strong> to save your changes.</li>\n</ol>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
